# Per-project MEMORY.md

Do not dump gotchas into this rule file.

When you work under a project folder that has (or should have) `MEMORY.md`, **read it first**. When something fails or a approach works, **append it there** in English, under `GOTCHA` or `TASTE`. Keep entries short and concrete.

Project folders in this repo:

- `docker-compose/MEMORY.md`
- `python/MEMORY.md`

## GOTCHA

Tried, did not work. Include the symptom and the real fix (or why it cannot work).

## TASTE

Tried, worked. Include the pattern to repeat.

## Format for each project MEMORY.md

```markdown
# <project folder name>

## GOTCHA

- ...

## TASTE

- ...
```